<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Defensa de la colonia lunar</title>

<style>
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
}

html, body {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #020307;
